    "title": "Fayetteville council poised to make changes to short-term rental ordinance - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Stacy Ryburn ,\n6 hours ago FAYETTEVILLE — The city’s ordinance regulating short-term rentals may get a few more tweaks at the next City Council meeting. The council will consider a few amendments on Tuesday dealing with occupancy, enforcement and density related to the ordinance. The council’s Ordinance Review Committee, consisting of half of its members, met numerous times over the last several months to come up with the changes. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
